WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.188
Hello, and welcome to Drone Career Explorer —

00:00:03.188 --> 00:00:08.197
a Future Ready AI learning experience designed for high school students.

00:00:08.197 --> 00:00:12.750
This program introduces students to the fast-growing world of drones

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:17.304
while helping them explore how technology connects to real careers,

00:00:17.304 --> 00:00:20.036
real industries, and real-world problem solving.

00:00:20.036 --> 00:00:23.841
In the high school Drone Career Explorer program,

00:00:23.841 --> 00:00:28.122
students learn that drones are more than flying devices.

00:00:28.122 --> 00:00:32.878
They are part of larger systems that connect people, technology,

00:00:32.878 --> 00:00:34.781
data, process, and purpose.

00:00:34.781 --> 00:00:39.062
Students begin to understand how these parts work together

00:00:39.062 --> 00:00:42.867
to solve complex problems and create meaningful solutions.

00:00:42.867 --> 00:00:47.569
Students also build a strong foundation in responsible drone innovation.

00:00:47.569 --> 00:00:51.330
They explore how safety, privacy, ethics, and regulations

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:56.032
shape how drones should be used in the real world.

00:00:56.032 --> 00:01:01.674
This helps students understand that innovation must always be paired with responsibility,

00:01:01.674 --> 00:01:04.025
sound judgment, and thoughtful decision-making.

00:01:04.025 --> 00:01:10.324
Throughout the program, students investigate how drones are transforming industries

00:01:10.324 --> 00:01:14.103
such as construction, agriculture, logistics, mapping,

00:01:14.103 --> 00:01:17.252
public safety, infrastructure, and media.

00:01:17.252 --> 00:01:21.661
These examples help students connect classroom learning

00:01:21.661 --> 00:01:26.700
to emerging career pathways, entrepreneurship, and future innovation.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:31.311
As students move through the course, they apply their learning

00:01:31.311 --> 00:01:34.539
through reflection, planning, and authentic problem solving.

00:01:34.539 --> 00:01:38.690
The program culminates in a Drone Career Challenge capstone,

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:43.301
where students design a drone-enabled solution to a real-world problem.

00:01:43.301 --> 00:01:47.451
They also develop portfolio evidence that showcases their growth,

00:01:47.451 --> 00:01:49.296
ideas, and career-connected thinking.

00:01:49.296 --> 00:01:52.727
Drone Career Explorer helps students think critically,

00:01:52.727 --> 00:01:55.177
design responsibly, and lead confidently.

00:01:55.177 --> 00:01:59.588
It is a future-focused learning experience that blends technology,

00:01:59.588 --> 00:02:02.039
creativity, career exploration, and innovation.

00:02:02.039 --> 00:02:07.920
We are excited to help students discover how drones can support industries,

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.841
solve problems, and open doors to new possibilities.
